<title>MEXICO: Herdez nine-month net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Herdez nine-month net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Oper Income	113.72 million	     109.86 million</p>
<p>	Net		  83.81 million		37.37 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 1.174 bln		1.231 bln</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Grupo Herdez SA de CV</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom, (525) 728-9507</p>
</text>
